      },
      "cr": 1,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Parson Pellinost.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, generated from the article's own words. XP ledger: level 2, power rating 4 → CR 1 as a spellcaster. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Repo-Mage of Healthcare</strong> — Mages' Guild (Medical Division)</p><p>Status: Active — Wandering Raventree Manor demanding co-pays</p><p>Parson Pellinost is a 'doctor' for the Mages' Guild who perfectly illustrates the Guild's approach to charity. He bypassed heavy magical wards to enter a barricaded room, healed an injured Archie Miser, informed him he was now in debt, and when Archie demanded a refund, Pellinost forcibly ripped the healing magic back out of Archie's body. Waluigi finds the sheer, unadulterated pettiness of this act to be a breathtaking display of aggressive capitalism. WAH.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Sabre</strong> — “He does not need a sword if the room already contains pain, fear, and someone desperate enough to sign whatever appears in front of them.”</li><li><strong>Hidden in Plain Sight</strong> — “He performs highly effective restorative magic, but his magic comes with an invisible, immediate contract.”</li><li><strong>Guild Spellcasting</strong> — “The Repo-Mage of Healthcare”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/parson_pellinost</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/parson_pellinost</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
